  "transcript_segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.68,
      "text": "They used to ask me, where were you?"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.68,
      "end": 11.8,
      "text": "Like absence was a decision, like I misplaced my childhood"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.8,
      "end": 17.36,
      "text": "between bus tickets and unfamiliar ceilings."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.36,
      "end": 20.48,
      "text": "I never stayed anywhere long enough for the furniture"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.48,
      "end": 27.88,
      "text": "to remember my shape, another eye of dress, another hallway,"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.88,
      "end": 33.48,
      "text": "another temporary name."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.48,
      "end": 36.36,
      "text": "Suitcases learned my way before people did."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.36,
      "end": 39.48,
      "text": "Every door opened halfway then quietly hit."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.48,
      "end": 42.24,
      "text": "Label stick faster than kindness ever could."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.24,
      "end": 44.68,
      "text": "Problem child stamped in the splinter wood,"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.68,
      "end": 47.84,
      "text": "bought in homes like stations on a line with no end."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.84,
      "end": 50.16,
      "text": "Caratakers changed before they could pretend"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.16,
      "end": 53.32,
      "text": "that I was anything more than a file in a drawer."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.32,
      "end": 56.44,
      "text": "A storm someone else was responsible for."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.44,
      "end": 62.04,
      "text": "I learned early, not to finish sentences."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.04,
      "end": 67.4,
      "text": "Because goodbye always interrupted them."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.4,
      "end": 69.84,
      "text": "Where were you?"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.84,
      "end": 78.52,
      "text": "When the night stretched then, when silence spoke louder and skinned."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.52,
      "end": 81.0,
      "text": "Where were you?"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.0,
      "end": 89.56,
      "text": "When the years fell through, like coins in a well I never knew."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.56,
      "end": 93.16,
      "text": "I memorized exits before I memorized faces."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.16,
      "end": 95.64,
      "text": "Friends were temporary weather patterns."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.64,
      "end": 100.48,
      "text": "By the time someone learned how I took my coffee, I was already gone."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.48,
      "end": 103.64,
      "text": "Teachers spoke about potential like it was a crime scene."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.64,
      "end": 106.64,
      "text": "Counselors asked questions with answers at it, nowhere to live."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.64,
      "end": 110.12,
      "text": "And somewhere between behavior or reporting,"
    },
    {
      "start": 110.12,
      "end": 111.6,
      "text": "we'll place them somewhere else."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.6,
      "end": 117.56,
      "text": "I learned how to disappear while standing in the room."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.56,
      "end": 120.04,
      "text": "Where were you?"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.04,
      "end": 128.72,
      "text": "When the winter stayed inside the bones, I never outcrew."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.72,
      "end": 131.2,
      "text": "Where were you?"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.2,
      "end": 139.48,
      "text": "In the endless blue of days that nobody walked through."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.48,
      "end": 147.88,
      "text": "Funny thing about loneliness, you stopped believing the universe misplaced you."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.88,
      "end": 151.56,
      "text": "Like you're an extra page in a book that was already finished."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.56,
      "end": 162.68,
      "text": "But then one day in the middle of a very ordinary moment, the room changed shape."
    },
    {
      "start": 162.68,
      "end": 166.16,
      "text": "There you were like a lighthouse, someone forgot to mention."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.16,
      "end": 170.88,
      "text": "High gravity, gentle intervention, no thunder, no grand design."
    },
    {
      "start": 170.88,
      "end": 176.16,
      "text": "Just your voice saying, hey, you doing alright and something ancient in the dark of my mind."
    },
    {
      "start": 176.16,
      "end": 178.92,
      "text": "Shifting an inch toward life for the first time."
    },
    {
      "start": 178.92,
      "end": 181.92,
      "text": "Like maybe the years weren't only debris."
    },
    {
      "start": 181.92,
      "end": 184.6,
      "text": "Maybe they were roads that were leading to me."
    },
    {
      "start": 184.6,
      "end": 187.4,
      "text": "Standing exactly where I needed to be."
    },
    {
      "start": 187.4,
      "end": 193.4,
      "text": "There you are, where the lost roads bend."
    },
    {
      "start": 193.4,
      "end": 198.72,
      "text": "Where the broken years make sense again."
    },
    {
      "start": 198.72,
      "end": 209.56,
      "text": "There you are, in the quiet view of a light fire almost never knew."
    },
    {
      "start": 209.56,
      "end": 213.52,
      "text": "If we had met sooner, maybe the map would look different."
    },
    {
      "start": 213.52,
      "end": 216.28,
      "text": "Maybe the winner would have been shorter."
    },
    {
      "start": 216.28,
      "end": 220.48,
      "text": "Maybe the boy who kept leaving places would have learned how to stay."
    },
    {
      "start": 220.48,
      "end": 223.32,
      "text": "But then again, maybe every wrong turn."
    },
    {
      "start": 223.32,
      "end": 227.84,
      "text": "Every borrow bedroom, every labeled mistake was just time."
    },
    {
      "start": 227.84,
      "end": 234.52,
      "text": "Taking a long way so that one day I could finally say where you are."
    },
    {
      "start": 234.52,
      "end": 243.28,
      "text": "Where the darkness ends, where a stranger finally finds a friend."
    },
    {
      "start": 243.28,
      "end": 254.36,
      "text": "There you are, in the over-to-blue of a life that almost lost its view."
    },
    {
      "start": 254.36,
      "end": 259.12,
      "text": "All those years they kept asking me, where are you?"
    },
    {
      "start": 259.12,
      "end": 267.12,
      "text": "Funny thing is, I was just waiting to ask the same thing when I found you."
    },
    {
      "start": 273.28,
      "end": 280.28,
      "text": "When I found you."
    }
  ],
